Drag the Trust Boundary shape onto the canvas 3 times:

Drag one over Human User → double-click its label and name it User Layer.

Drag the second around AI Agent, MCP Server, and RAG Pipeline → name it Agent Layer.

Drag the third around Auth0, LLM Provider, and Internal REST API → name it Internal API Layer.

Capture Screenshot 1 (satisfies Project 1 — Requirement 1).

Step 2: Add 3 Threats to Auth0 (Takes 40 Seconds)
Click directly on the Auth0 node on your canvas (a red selection boundary will appear around it).

Look at the bottom-right panel under Threats and click the + Add Threat button.

Add these 3 threats:

Threat 1:

Title: Account Takeover via Credential Theft

Type: Select Spoofing

Severity: Select High / Critical

Click Save

Threat 2:

Title: Token Theft & Replay Attack

Type: Select Spoofing

Severity: Select Critical

Click Save

Threat 3:

Title: Authorization Scope Escalation

Type: Select Elevation of privilege

Severity: Select High

Click Save

Step 3: Capture Screenshot 2
Keep the Auth0 node selected so that:

The canvas shows your full diagram with trust boundaries above.

The bottom-left panel shows the Properties for Auth0.

The bottom-right panel displays the 3 red STRIDE cards.

Take your screenshot to satisfy Project 1 — Requirement 2.

